description: Python and PySpark standards for pipeline jobs
globs: databricks/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# PySpark / Python

- Python 3.11+, type hints on public functions
- Use `SparkSession.getActiveSession()` in jobs — never `sys.exit()` (Databricks treats as failure)
- Ruff formatting, max line 88
- Log row counts and timestamps at Bronze ingest
